{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":19,"created_at":"2026-02-15T02:47:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T01:30:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Depends on #116300 (ignore those commits)\r\n\r\nLike #116300, this uses generated trampolines. Not only does this allow us to cache the `Type`, but we can also take advantage of `UnsafeAccessorAttribute` (introduced in .NET 8) to bypass reflection entirely when calling `.ctor` (the cost should be the same as a direct method call).\r\n\r\nIt may be worth checking if godot-dotnet (GDExtension) can benefit from `UnsafeAccessor`. From the looks of it, they seem to do construction differently though, so it's probably irrelevant there.\r\n\r\n**NOTE:** To avoid potential regressions, only parameterless constructor calls go through trampolines. This is because we have no guarantee for the overload chosen by the generator (in case of multiple candidates with the same parameter count) to be the same as the one we get with reflection (the old way we were calling them).\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I changed the built-in constructors map to use `delegate*` instead of normal delegates. This should be slightly faster. We might want to further improve this by storing these function pointers in C++, like we do in #116300.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}